7901004,2023-11-25,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Personal information incorrect,"I am writing to file a formal complaint against XXXX, XXXX, and Equifax for their continued reporting of an inaccurate and closed child support account on my credit report, which is in violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), specifically under U.S. Code Title 15, Section 1681. 

