2. Ensure the immediate deletion of the inaccurately reported and closed child support account from my credit report. 
3. Confirm that all future reports byXXXX, Equifax and XXXX ] are accurate and compliant with the FCRA. 

Enclosed with this letter are copies of my previous correspondence with [ Credit Reporting Agencys Name ], as well as evidence supporting the closure of the child support account and the discrepancy in the name reported. 

I appreciate your prompt attention to this matter and look forward to a resolution that corrects my credit report and upholds the standards of accuracy and fairness as mandated by the FCRA. 

Enclosed is the statement from the agency closing my account along with the continued inaccurate information pertaining to my legal name. Also enclosed is my legal ID and proof of my legal name which proves this account inaccurate and in violation.",,"EQUIFAX, INC.",CA,925XX,,Web,2023-11-25,Closed with explanation,Yes
